sequenceDiagram
    participant Trk as ByteTrack (edge)
    participant Ref as Reference-Point Selector (edge)
    participant Cache as Polygon Cache (edge, shapely)
    participant Edge as Edge SlotMapper
    participant Q as SQLite Queue
    participant BE as Backend Ingest API
    participant PG as PostGIS (authoritative)
    participant SM as Occupancy State Machine
    participant DB as Occupancy / History / Outbox

    Trk->>Ref: track_id, bbox, plate?
    Ref->>Ref: compute footprint point (bbox bottom-center)
    Ref->>Cache: reference point
    Cache->>Edge: candidate slot_id + geometric confidence (cached polygons)
    Edge->>Q: enqueue VehicleDetected observation (provisional)
    Q->>BE: POST ingest (event_id, tracker, point, map version, occurred_at)
    BE->>PG: ST_Covers(slot_polygon, vehicle_point)
    PG-->>BE: authoritative slot_id
    BE->>SM: ordered authoritative observation
    alt transition guard commits
        SM->>DB: occupancy + history + event + outbox atomically
    else disagreement or unstable candidate
        SM->>DB: last-seen/audit only; hold occupancy
        BE-->>Edge: polygon cache invalidation signal (next poll / heartbeat)
    end
    DB-->>BE: ack
    BE-->>Q: 200 OK
